cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Domain-Stratified NMT Corpus Builder
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: singhmanyu
    email: abhi.nmt2022@gmail.com
repository-code: https://github.com/singhmanyu/Domain-Stratified-NMT-Corpus-Builder
abstract: >-
  A two-stage domain classifier that splits a parallel corpus into domains
  for stratified NMT training. It reads only the English side, so it applies
  to any language pair with English on one side, and the translation is
  carried through aligned. Stage 1 routes with nvidia/domain-classifier; the
  rows its taxonomy cannot place are decided by a fastText classifier trained
  on LLM-generated seed labels, so no hand-labelled training set is
  required.
keywords:
  - domain classification
  - machine translation
  - parallel corpus
  - weak supervision
  - knowledge distillation
  - low-resource languages
  - nepali
  - multilingual
license: MIT
